# Project Structure

This project is a Turborepo monorepo. The Expo mobile app lives in `apps/mobile/`.

```
deckscores/                     → Monorepo root
  apps/
    mobile/                     → Expo app
      app/                      → Expo Router screens (file-based routing)
        (tabs)/                 → Tab layout group
          _layout.tsx           → Tab navigator layout
          index.tsx             → First tab screen
        (auth)/                 → Auth layout group (login, register, etc.)
          _layout.tsx           → Auth flow layout
        _layout.tsx             → Root layout (providers, fonts, splash)
        index.tsx               → Entry redirect / home screen
        [id].tsx                → Dynamic route
        +not-found.tsx          → 404 screen
      components/               → Reusable UI components
      hooks/                    → Custom React hooks
      lib/                      → API client, utilities, helpers
      stores/                   → Zustand state stores
      constants/                → Theme, colors, spacing, typography tokens
      assets/                   → Images, fonts, static files
      types/                    → Mobile-specific TypeScript types
    web/                        → Next.js app (landing page + API)
      app/
        page.tsx                → Landing page
        api/                    → API route handlers
      lib/                      → MongoDB client, server helpers
  packages/
    shared/                     → Shared TypeScript types + constants
      src/types/                → Database types, API contracts
```

## Expo Router Conventions

- **Layouts:** Every route group needs a `_layout.tsx` that defines the navigator (Stack, Tabs, etc.).
- **Groups:** Use `(groupName)/` to organize routes without affecting the URL path (e.g., `(tabs)/`, `(auth)/`).
- **Dynamic routes:** Use `[param].tsx` for dynamic segments (e.g., `app/user/[id].tsx`).
- **Not found:** Use `+not-found.tsx` for unmatched routes.

## Where Things Go

| What | Location | Example |
|------|----------|---------|
| Screens / pages | `apps/mobile/app/` | `app/(tabs)/index.tsx` |
| Reusable components | `apps/mobile/components/` | `components/Button.tsx` |
| Custom hooks | `apps/mobile/hooks/` | `hooks/useAuth.ts` |
| API client + helpers | `apps/mobile/lib/` | `lib/api.ts` |
| Zustand stores | `apps/mobile/stores/` | `stores/useUserStore.ts` |
| Design tokens | `apps/mobile/constants/` | `constants/colors.ts` |
| Mobile-specific types | `apps/mobile/types/` | `types/user.ts` |
| Static assets | `apps/mobile/assets/` | `assets/images/logo.png` |
| Shared types | `packages/shared/src/types/` | `types/profile.ts` |
| API routes | `apps/web/app/api/` | `api/profiles/route.ts` |
| MongoDB client | `apps/web/lib/` | `lib/mongodb.ts` |
